WEBVTT

00:00:01.430 --> 00:00:03.300
﻿It's finally completed.

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:03.870
﻿Yeah.

00:00:04.470 --> 00:00:06.770
﻿Equipped with a Trans-Am booster,

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:11.080
﻿it's the true form of the Amazing Exia.

00:00:11.540 --> 00:00:12.910
﻿Allan.

00:00:12.910 --> 00:00:14.710
﻿I swear by this Gunpla,

00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:21.890
﻿tomorrow's final battle will thrill
﻿Gunpla fans around the world.

00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:23.860
﻿Yes.

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:26.430
﻿That's not good enough!

00:00:27.830 --> 00:00:30.000
﻿Chairman Mashita.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.830
﻿Meijin, I want you to win.

00:00:34.270 --> 00:00:38.370
﻿Otherwise, it wasn't worth
﻿making a works team for you.

00:00:38.810 --> 00:00:41.770
﻿Of course, I'll try to win.

00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:43.480
﻿But, more than that,

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:45.910
﻿I want to show the world
﻿what a true Meijin—

00:00:45.910 --> 00:00:48.280
﻿Forget such childish thoughts!

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:49.920
﻿Just win.

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:54.690
﻿If you win, you'll get
﻿honor, glory and praise.

00:00:55.050 --> 00:00:57.090
﻿You can have everything!

00:00:57.660 --> 00:01:02.460
﻿But you must hit your opponent's
﻿weak points, ignore his pleas,

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:06.400
﻿and smash him until he stops moving.

00:01:06.530 --> 00:01:09.300
﻿Yes, just like the second Meijin.

00:01:10.270 --> 00:01:12.070
﻿N-No...

00:01:12.440 --> 00:01:18.080
﻿Did you push your philosophy
﻿on him and make him a demon...?

00:01:18.680 --> 00:01:19.780
﻿Is that bad?

00:01:20.550 --> 00:01:22.910
﻿I reject your philosophy!

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:25.420
﻿Alright. Then I have no choice.

00:01:28.390 --> 00:01:29.960
﻿Wh-What!?

00:01:30.360 --> 00:01:31.620
﻿Allan!

00:01:31.620 --> 00:01:32.820
﻿Meijin.

00:01:33.390 --> 00:01:36.360
﻿I brought you a special present.

00:01:38.930 --> 00:01:41.400
﻿Sorry, but this is business.

00:01:42.900 --> 00:01:44.340
﻿That mask...

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:47.070
﻿It's an improved Embody.

00:01:47.070 --> 00:01:50.710
﻿When you put on this,
﻿you'll be reborn...

00:01:51.680 --> 00:01:57.150
﻿as a demon that pursues
﻿nothing other than victory.

00:03:39.420 --> 00:03:42.590
<i>﻿We now begin the final round of...</i>

00:03:42.690 --> 00:03:46.430
<i>﻿the Gunpla Battle Championship
﻿World Tournament.</i>

00:03:57.440 --> 00:04:00.910
﻿Hey, what's with the new look?

00:04:00.910 --> 00:04:04.340
﻿Are you trying to show off
﻿because it's the final round?

00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:14.790
﻿What's this pressure
﻿coming from the Meijin?

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:18.260
﻿Ramba, do you recognize
﻿this hostile will?

00:04:18.260 --> 00:04:20.060
﻿It reminds me of the second.

00:04:20.330 --> 00:04:23.230
﻿It's the same as the second Meijin's.

00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:26.370
﻿President Yuuki...

00:04:26.730 --> 00:04:29.700
﻿He has a strange aura about him.

00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:33.140
﻿I don't know what's up with him,

00:04:33.140 --> 00:04:35.980
﻿but we'll find out when we fight.

00:04:35.980 --> 00:04:36.910
﻿Yeah.

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:41.080
﻿Let's give it our all
﻿and make this a great battle!

00:04:41.620 --> 00:04:43.020
﻿Yeah, man!

00:04:43.050 --> 00:04:45.720
<i>﻿Beginning Plavsky particle dispersal.</i>

00:04:49.320 --> 00:04:51.620
<i>﻿Field 1, Space.</i>

00:04:54.130 --> 00:04:55.630
- ﻿Sei Iori.
- ﻿Reiji.

00:04:55.760 --> 00:04:58.100
﻿- Star Build Strike.
﻿- Let's go!

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:01.300
﻿What!?

00:05:05.340 --> 00:05:06.770
﻿Right out of the gate...!

00:05:13.280 --> 00:05:15.180
﻿Reiji, the Absorb Shield!

00:05:15.420 --> 00:05:15.920
﻿Yeah!

00:05:24.330 --> 00:05:25.120
﻿It's ready!

00:05:25.360 --> 00:05:26.830
﻿Okay!

00:05:37.670 --> 00:05:39.570
﻿Discharge! Maximum output!

00:05:40.040 --> 00:05:43.040
﻿Take this!

00:05:56.960 --> 00:05:57.590
﻿What's that!?

00:05:58.030 --> 00:06:00.460
﻿That's Mr. Nils's technique!

00:06:17.510 --> 00:06:18.980
﻿The main camera..!

00:06:27.760 --> 00:06:28.960
﻿Darn!

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:37.030
- ﻿Reiji!
﻿- Iori!

00:06:37.730 --> 00:06:39.070
﻿Sei.

00:06:39.070 --> 00:06:41.300
﻿That relentless fighting style.

00:06:41.300 --> 00:06:43.000
﻿Just like the second Meijin.

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:49.240
﻿But why is Yuuki fighting like that?

00:06:51.380 --> 00:06:52.750
﻿Stop the match!

00:06:52.750 --> 00:06:54.910
﻿This isn't the battle he wanted!

00:06:55.250 --> 00:06:57.850
﻿But Chairman Mashita wants it.

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:01.720
﻿Wh-What!?

00:07:02.260 --> 00:07:04.320
﻿What's going on!?

00:07:04.330 --> 00:07:06.430
﻿The Plavsky particle crystal...

00:07:06.890 --> 00:07:08.660
﻿is it resonating with something?

00:07:23.780 --> 00:07:25.280
﻿Good! Defeat them!

00:07:25.280 --> 00:07:26.580
﻿Defeat them!

00:07:29.450 --> 00:07:32.990
﻿An effect that can interfere
﻿with human consciousness, eh?

00:07:33.750 --> 00:07:38.890
﻿I thought Arista could only
﻿be used to move Gunpla.

00:07:39.590 --> 00:07:43.030
﻿I had no idea we could use it
﻿like this, Miss Baker!

00:07:43.030 --> 00:07:45.370
﻿It's thanks to PPSE's science team.

00:07:46.500 --> 00:07:50.300
﻿Your wishes, your drive for victory,

00:07:50.300 --> 00:07:52.740
﻿are being amplified by
﻿the huge underground Arista.

00:07:53.870 --> 00:07:56.410
It's controlling the Meijin's consciousness...

00:07:57.410 --> 00:07:59.850
﻿via the Flana Institute's improved Embody.

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:04.250
﻿Chairman, with this power,
﻿you could have any—

00:08:04.850 --> 00:08:06.090
﻿No,

00:08:06.090 --> 00:08:08.520
﻿you could have the entire world!

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:11.460
﻿I'm not interested in that.

00:08:11.460 --> 00:08:13.490
﻿It would be a lot of work.

00:08:13.490 --> 00:08:15.530
﻿I just want to be rich,

00:08:15.530 --> 00:08:19.700
﻿and spend the rest of my life at ease.

00:08:19.700 --> 00:08:21.930
﻿I-I'm sorry.

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:25.840
﻿In Arian I was a petty thief.

00:08:25.840 --> 00:08:28.980
﻿When I snuck into the treasure room
﻿of the palace,

00:08:28.980 --> 00:08:32.180
﻿the Arista reacted and I was
﻿thrown into this world.

00:08:36.480 --> 00:08:38.550
﻿I'd completely lost my bearings.

00:08:38.820 --> 00:08:40.550
﻿But then I met Miss Baker,

00:08:40.550 --> 00:08:44.690
﻿and we came up with the business
﻿of using Arista for Gunpla Battle.

00:08:44.690 --> 00:08:47.530
﻿And so I succeeded in this world.

00:08:49.230 --> 00:08:51.200
﻿
﻿can give up his position now.

00:08:51.900 --> 00:08:56.370
﻿If I return to Arian,
﻿I'll be arrested as a criminal.

00:08:56.370 --> 00:09:00.970
﻿So Prince Reiji must never
﻿learn my true identity!

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:05.380
﻿Win, third Meijin Kawaguchi!

00:09:05.380 --> 00:09:07.510
﻿Win, and get rid of that boy!

00:09:08.720 --> 00:09:11.350
﻿For the sake of my peaceful life!

00:09:13.150 --> 00:09:14.790
﻿He's only aiming for the joints!?

00:09:14.790 --> 00:09:16.590
﻿He's strong, but petty!

00:09:17.320 --> 00:09:18.590
<i>﻿Field change.</i>

00:09:18.590 --> 00:09:19.130
﻿What?

00:09:22.500 --> 00:09:23.960
﻿The field changed!

00:09:23.960 --> 00:09:24.630
﻿Why!?

00:09:31.510 --> 00:09:33.170
﻿What?

00:09:33.410 --> 00:09:34.770
﻿What's going on!

00:09:35.180 --> 00:09:36.640
﻿The Exia is coming!

00:09:42.380 --> 00:09:43.880
﻿Darn you!

00:09:54.330 --> 00:09:55.330
T﻿his sword—!

00:10:09.310 --> 00:10:11.340
﻿How dare you!

00:10:25.090 --> 00:10:27.390
﻿The Star Build Strike...!

00:10:31.100 --> 00:10:33.170
﻿Iori's Gunpla is...

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:36.340
﻿Is this it for them?

00:10:41.480 --> 00:10:43.240
﻿No way...

00:10:48.580 --> 00:10:51.050
﻿That's good, Meijin.

00:10:54.690 --> 00:10:56.120
﻿Destroy...

00:10:58.090 --> 00:11:01.860
﻿Destroy it.

00:11:05.300 --> 00:11:07.670
﻿Move! Move!

00:11:08.040 --> 00:11:09.640
﻿Just move!!!

00:11:10.400 --> 00:11:11.540
﻿We'll fight!

00:11:11.970 --> 00:11:14.440
﻿Please move!

00:11:15.010 --> 00:11:16.340
<i>﻿Star Build Strike!</i>

00:11:17.010 --> 00:11:19.010
﻿This battle isn't over yet!

00:11:19.810 --> 00:11:21.180
﻿Not yet!

00:11:22.020 --> 00:11:24.880
﻿That's right, Prince.

00:11:25.350 --> 00:11:27.950
﻿You've caused me so much grief!

00:11:32.630 --> 00:11:33.960
﻿I'm furious!

00:11:39.130 --> 00:11:40.300
﻿Iori.

00:11:40.630 --> 00:11:43.070
﻿Sei's Gunpla is...

00:11:44.440 --> 00:11:46.010
﻿Where are you going, Takeshi!?

00:11:46.010 --> 00:11:49.380
﻿I'll protest to the organizers
about them changing the field,

00:11:49.380 --> 00:11:52.140
﻿as an International Gunpla Battle
﻿Official Referee.

00:11:52.150 --> 00:11:53.550
﻿Stop it.

00:11:53.550 --> 00:11:59.020
﻿I know you're worried about your son,
﻿but don't meddle in a battle.

00:11:59.020 --> 00:12:00.890
﻿The die has been cast.

00:12:02.490 --> 00:12:04.320
﻿Sei...!

00:12:06.630 --> 00:12:09.400
﻿Huh? Aren't you fighting back?

00:12:09.630 --> 00:12:12.000
﻿It's almost too easy.

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:15.230
﻿Chairman, it's better to
﻿finish it off immediately...

00:12:15.240 --> 00:12:17.370
﻿It's alright.

00:12:17.370 --> 00:12:20.140
﻿The Meijin's victory is nailed down.

00:12:20.140 --> 00:12:24.540
﻿As long as my strong will
﻿controls the Meijin!

00:12:24.980 --> 00:12:26.050
﻿What?

00:12:26.950 --> 00:12:27.750
﻿Whose voice was that?

00:12:29.820 --> 00:12:31.680
﻿The gem that Sei gave me...

00:12:32.920 --> 00:12:35.350
﻿Who said "controls the Meijin"?

00:12:38.630 --> 00:12:40.790
﻿Could it be the Embody!?

00:12:43.200 --> 00:12:45.770
﻿Yuuki...

00:12:45.770 --> 00:12:48.270
﻿Why... Why...?

00:12:49.150 --> 00:12:50.040
Iori.

00:12:50.670 --> 00:12:51.940
﻿Reiji.

00:12:52.470 --> 00:12:55.740
﻿Let's fight a great battle
﻿in the final round next week.

00:12:56.640 --> 00:13:01.180
﻿So that people all over the world
﻿can feel the joys of Gunpla.

00:13:01.950 --> 00:13:07.790
﻿Is this the kind of battle
﻿you meant, Yuuki?

00:13:08.260 --> 00:13:10.820
﻿Then, I...!

00:13:11.860 --> 00:13:13.090
﻿Reiji.

00:13:14.060 --> 00:13:15.030
﻿This voice...

00:13:15.400 --> 00:13:16.700
﻿Aila!?

00:13:17.930 --> 00:13:21.400
﻿Reiji. Sei. Kawaguchi is...

00:13:22.040 --> 00:13:23.340
﻿What!?

00:13:23.340 --> 00:13:24.470
﻿He's being controlled!?

00:13:25.510 --> 00:13:28.840
﻿Could it be that mask!?

00:13:32.610 --> 00:13:35.250
﻿Reiji, let's stop the battle
﻿and save Yuuki.

00:13:35.250 --> 00:13:36.920
﻿Keep fighting, Sei.

00:13:36.920 --> 00:13:37.650
﻿What!?

00:13:37.850 --> 00:13:40.050
﻿We'll settle this with a battle.

00:13:40.050 --> 00:13:45.590
﻿Well awaken him and win
﻿the tournament all at once!

00:13:48.500 --> 00:13:49.430
﻿Right?

00:13:50.460 --> 00:13:52.870
﻿Oh, boy. You're stubborn!

00:13:56.770 --> 00:13:58.270
﻿- Let's go!
- ﻿Yeah!

00:14:01.480 --> 00:14:02.710
﻿The Build Strike is...

00:14:03.080 --> 00:14:04.010
﻿It's glowing!

00:14:06.550 --> 00:14:07.880
﻿Purge the right shoulder!

00:14:23.900 --> 00:14:26.700
﻿How'd someone like you
﻿get controlled so easily!?

00:14:28.870 --> 00:14:30.040
﻿We'll crush you!

00:14:30.400 --> 00:14:31.700
<i>﻿Prepare yourself!</i>

00:14:33.540 --> 00:14:35.980
﻿What am I doing...?

00:14:37.540 --> 00:14:39.910
﻿Is the prince's Arista doing this?

00:14:41.380 --> 00:14:43.720
﻿Meijin, don't hesitate!

00:14:43.720 --> 00:14:46.320
﻿Defeat it, whatever it takes!

00:14:57.960 --> 00:14:58.930
﻿The Trans-Am!

00:14:59.270 --> 00:15:01.370
﻿In a tight space like this!

00:15:05.610 --> 00:15:06.940
﻿Where are you going!?

00:15:12.150 --> 00:15:14.010
﻿Change the field!

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:14.750
﻿Mr. Barthes!

00:15:15.550 --> 00:15:17.680
<i>﻿Increase the system's output!</i>

00:15:18.000 --> 00:15:19.320
B-But...

00:15:19.320 --> 00:15:20.590
﻿I won't let you!

00:15:50.620 --> 00:15:51.250
﻿Reiji!

00:15:51.380 --> 00:15:52.120
﻿Yeah!

00:16:11.340 --> 00:16:13.270
﻿Take this!!!

00:16:32.730 --> 00:16:35.090
﻿This is the moment of truth.

00:16:35.460 --> 00:16:38.000
﻿But the Exia is still in Trans-Am.

00:16:38.400 --> 00:16:40.670
﻿Look, Sei and Reiji have...

00:16:42.070 --> 00:16:45.340
﻿The Star Build Strike has the RG!

00:16:45.940 --> 00:16:46.840
﻿Let's go!

00:16:49.080 --> 00:16:52.110
﻿RG System, full release!

00:16:55.280 --> 00:16:59.850
﻿Build Knuckle!

00:17:06.930 --> 00:17:07.960
﻿Darn!

00:17:08.600 --> 00:17:09.600
﻿Too fast!

00:17:10.430 --> 00:17:13.000
﻿It's only attacking the broken parts!

00:17:23.280 --> 00:17:25.180
﻿Darn! At this rate...!

00:17:29.680 --> 00:17:32.520
﻿Okay, Meijin. Finish them!

00:17:39.530 --> 00:17:40.990
﻿Yuuki.

00:17:43.560 --> 00:17:47.370
﻿With this, we'll awaken you!

00:17:54.770 --> 00:17:57.640
﻿- With our...
- ﻿Gunpla!

00:18:00.050 --> 00:18:03.540
- ﻿RG...
- Double Build...

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:08.550
- Knuckle!

00:19:19.960 --> 00:19:21.430
<i>﻿Battle ended.</i>

00:19:21.800 --> 00:19:24.630
<i>﻿The winner of the final round of...</i>

00:19:25.130 --> 00:19:29.030
<i>﻿the 7th Gunpla Battle Championship
﻿World Tournament is...</i>

00:19:29.300 --> 00:19:32.840
<i>﻿the Sei Iori and Reiji team!</i>

00:19:36.680 --> 00:19:38.910
﻿Mr. Sei and Mr. Reiji won!

00:19:38.910 --> 00:19:40.080
﻿Amazing.

00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:42.480
﻿Amazing, Reiji and Sei!

00:19:43.550 --> 00:19:45.880
﻿Hooray, Takeshi!

00:19:45.890 --> 00:19:47.350
﻿Yeah! Yeah!

00:19:47.620 --> 00:19:51.860
﻿Takeshi's son is really great.

00:19:52.760 --> 00:19:56.530
﻿You became the best builder
﻿in the world, Sei.

00:19:56.530 --> 00:19:59.030
﻿And you, Reiji...

00:19:59.030 --> 00:20:01.200
﻿You're the best fighter in the world!

00:20:01.670 --> 00:20:03.570
﻿They won, China!

00:20:03.570 --> 00:20:04.140
﻿Yeah!

00:20:05.270 --> 00:20:09.170
﻿Congratulations, Iori and Reiji.

00:20:09.180 --> 00:20:10.040
﻿But...

00:20:10.440 --> 00:20:12.210
﻿President Yuuki is...

00:20:18.150 --> 00:20:19.050
﻿Yuuki!

00:20:20.450 --> 00:20:23.090
﻿Iori. Reiji.

00:20:23.090 --> 00:20:25.290
﻿I'm sorry.

00:20:25.290 --> 00:20:26.990
﻿I ruined your final battle...

00:20:28.430 --> 00:20:30.830
﻿It's okay Yuuki.

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:32.030
﻿But...

00:20:32.030 --> 00:20:34.400
﻿Let's play Gunpla Battle again.

00:20:35.600 --> 00:20:40.370
﻿Let's show people all
﻿over the world the joys of Gunpla.

00:20:41.910 --> 00:20:42.880
﻿Yeah.

00:20:45.880 --> 00:20:47.680
﻿It's a promise.

00:20:48.380 --> 00:20:51.380
﻿Of course, I'll keep it.

00:20:59.330 --> 00:21:03.360
﻿But first, who was controlling you?

00:21:03.360 --> 00:21:04.200
﻿Where is he!?

00:21:08.770 --> 00:21:09.800
﻿H-He is!?

00:21:10.170 --> 00:21:12.770
﻿PPSE's Chairman Mashita!?

00:21:14.940 --> 00:21:17.010
﻿No! No!

00:21:17.010 --> 00:21:19.650
﻿No!!!

00:21:26.050 --> 00:21:28.290
﻿Look at the particle emission level!

00:21:28.290 --> 00:21:30.260
﻿It's dangerous, isn't it?

00:21:32.260 --> 00:21:34.130
﻿Miss. Mr. Nils.

00:21:35.360 --> 00:21:36.300
﻿Sebastian!

00:21:36.830 --> 00:21:39.200
﻿The system is out of control...!

00:21:39.200 --> 00:21:40.600
﻿What!?

00:21:40.600 --> 00:21:41.970
﻿Stop it right now!

00:21:44.070 --> 00:21:44.940
﻿We can't.

00:21:54.110 --> 00:21:55.350
﻿Wh-What?

00:21:56.220 --> 00:21:57.750
﻿Plavsky particles?

00:21:57.750 --> 00:21:59.590
﻿The arena is...!

00:22:09.360 --> 00:22:11.630
﻿Th-That's...!?

00:23:55.450 --> 00:23:57.590
﻿It was a story of only 4 months.

00:23:57.590 --> 00:24:00.190
﻿But those times would never lose their color.

00:24:00.190 --> 00:24:02.030
Final episode, "Promise".

00:24:02.030 --> 00:24:04.560
Gunpla Last Shooting!
